      "line": 14,
      "start": 107,
      "quote": "愉子綏，玄之外甥",
      "sha256": "88da739ec68f6114fdca1344b9d5b1e8e49b9cbd0cc7d07506aed3b2a5c4ec8e",
      "note": "王愉子綏是桓玄外甥。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu092-ws2195614.wikitext",
      "revision": 2195614,
      "line": 14,
      "start": 158,
      "quote": "子弟五人，並臨陣見殺",
      "sha256": "88da739ec68f6114fdca1344b9d5b1e8e49b9cbd0cc7d07506aed3b2a5c4ec8e",
      "note": "本見證增載，子弟不等於傳主五個兒子；南24未寫。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu092-ws2195614.wikitext",
      "revision": 2195614,
      "line": 14,
      "start": 179,
      "quote": "妻子無以自給",
      "sha256": "88da739ec68f6114fdca1344b9d5b1e8e49b9cbd0cc7d07506aed3b2a5c4ec8e",
      "note": "南24無以自反，殿本南24亦作反。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu092-ws2195614.wikitext",
      "revision": 2195614,
      "line": 16,
      "start": 47,
      "quote": "必將繼美吳隱之",
      "sha256": "88da739ec68f6114fdca1344b9d5b1e8e49b9cbd0cc7d07506aed3b2a5c4ec8e",
      "note": "南24作呉隱，指其人。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu092-ws2195614.wikitext",
      "revision": 2195614,
      "line": 16,
      "start": 165,
      "quote": "永初三年，卒官，時年六十六",
      "sha256": "88da739ec68f6114fdca1344b9d5b1e8e49b9cbd0cc7d07506aed3b2a5c4ec8e",
      "note": "早證具年與報齡。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi024-ws1765279.wikitext",
      "revision": 1765279,
      "line": 77,
      "start": 126,
      "quote": "母隨兄鎭之之安成郡",
      "sha256": "8fd9281c1d58e066b75c0b6cce86fff07d6e11c8ad6426459f8e0f2139a29499",
      "note": "王弘之篇由弘之視點稱母，並記親往安成；原文無生母標記。"
    }
  ],
  "open_points": [],
  "numbers": [],
  "identity": [],
  "sentence_readings": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line071",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 26,
      "surface": "王鎭之字伯重，晉司州刺史胡之之從孫、而裕之從祖弟也。",
      "interpretation": "鎭之字伯重，與胡之、裕之的兩條旁系關係。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line071",
      "start": 26,
      "end": 43,
      "surface": "祖耆之，位中書郎，父隨之，上虞令。",
      "interpretation": "祖耆之及父隨之的職位。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line071",
      "start": 43,
      "end": 57,
      "surface": "鎭之爲剡、上虞令，並有能名。",
      "interpretation": "剡、上虞縣令。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line071",
      "start": 57,
      "end": 72,
      "surface": "桓玄輔晉，以爲大將軍録事參軍。",
      "interpretation": "任大將軍録事參軍。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line071",
      "start": 72,
      "end": 105,
      "surface": "時三呉饑荒，遣鎭之銜命賑恤，而會稽內史王愉不奉符旨，鎭之依事糾奏。",
      "interpretation": "奉命賑恤、劾王愉。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line071",
      "start": 105,
      "end": 126,
      "surface": "愉子綏，玄之外甥，當時貴盛，鎭之爲所排抑。",
      "interpretation": "綏是愉子、玄外甥，排抑鎭之。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line071",
      "start": 126,
      "end": 142,
      "surface": "以母老求補安成太守，以母憂去職。",
      "interpretation": "求安成俸養母，又丁母憂去職。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line071",
      "start": 142,
      "end": 165,
      "surface": "在官清潔，妻子無以自反，乃棄家致喪還上虞舊墓。",
      "interpretation": "妻子無以自反，棄家返舊墓。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line071",
      "start": 165,
      "end": 182,
      "surface": "葬畢，爲子標之求安復令，隨子之官。",
      "interpretation": "為標之求縣令，隨子之官。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line071",
      "start": 182,
      "end": 198,
      "surface": "服闋，爲征西道規司馬、南平太守。",
      "interpretation": "任劉道規司馬、南平太守。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line071",
      "start": 198,
      "end": 215,
      "surface": "後爲御史中丞，執正不撓，百僚憚之。",
      "interpretation": "轉御史中丞，執正見憚。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line073",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 22,
      "surface": "出爲建威將軍、平越中郎將、廣州刺史，加都督。",
      "interpretation": "出鎮廣州及都督。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line073",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 56,
      "surface": "宋武帝謂人曰：「鎭之少著清績，必將繼美呉隱，嶺南弊俗，非此不康也。」",
      "interpretation": "武帝以吳隱之比鎭之。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line073",
      "start": 56,
      "end": 78,
      "surface": "在鎭不受俸祿，蕭然無營，去官之日，不異初至。",
      "interpretation": "不受俸祿。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line073",
      "start": 78,
      "end": 96,
      "surface": "武帝初建相國府，爲諮議參軍，領録事。",
      "interpretation": "辟相國府諮議參軍領録事。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line073",
      "start": 96,
      "end": 106,
      "surface": "善於吏職，嚴而不殘。",
      "interpretation": "吏治嚴而不殘。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line073",
      "start": 106,
      "end": 114,
      "surface": "遷宋台祠部尚書。",
      "interpretation": "祠部尚書。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line073",
      "start": 114,
      "end": 126,
      "surface": "武帝踐阼，卒于宣訓衞尉。",
      "interpretation": "登極後卒於宣訓衞尉之官。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line073",
      "start": 126,
      "end": 130,
      "surface": "弟弘之。",
      "interpretation": "弟王弘之另有原題。"
    }
  ],
